    <briefdescription>
<para>Spatial index selection logic for Phase 6C. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Phase 6C Q3 2026 Delivery</para>
</simplesect>
ThemisDB | Query Module Phase 6C: Geospatial Phase 2</para>
<para>Implements automatic spatial index selection for query optimization. Selects between R-tree, grid-based indexes, or full scan based on:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Data distribution (clustered vs. uniform)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Predicate type (distance vs. containment)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Index statistics (size, hit rate)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Query characteristics </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
